cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this artifact, please cite both the software (this CITATION.cff)
  and the accompanying research paper (see `preferred-citation` below).
title: "FluidGPU: Fine-Grained Kernel Disaggregation for Large Model Inference on Heterogeneous GPUs"
abstract: >-
  FluidGPU is a fine-grained kernel disaggregation system for large-model
  inference on heterogeneous GPUs. It combines a PTX-level kernel analyzer
  for inter-kernel dependency extraction, workload-aware scheduling policies
  (throughput-oriented MILP and latency-oriented), pipelined disaggregated
  execution with priority-aware stream scheduling, and a lightweight online
  monitor for dynamic policy adaptation. This repository is the artifact
  accompanying the FluidGPU paper submitted to SC26.
type: software
authors:
